<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns:rx="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Reactive;assembly=Bonsai.Core"
                 xmlns:scr="clr-namespace:Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions;assembly=Bonsai.Scripting.Expressions"
                 xmlns:dev="clr-namespace:OpenRigs.Devices;assembly=OpenRigs.Devices"
                 xmlns:vc="clr-namespace:CoenQcCalibrateValve;assembly=Extensions"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>The spouts during a calibration or a delivery, so the drops land as in a session (Pip, 10 Nov 2026). On a rig whose rig.yml has a lick spout stage (RigConfigs' stepperDriver), Stage runs the lab's stage piece, OpenRigs.Devices LickSpoutStage (StepperDriver-A and -B): it homes every motor and moves the spouts in, to the SubjectId's row of LickSpoutPositions.csv beside rig.yml or else rig.yml's lickSpoutDefaultPosition. SubjectId is the workflow's NoExperimentFolder's default, _no-experiment_, never a mouse's row, since a calibration is no mouse's, so the spouts go to lickSpoutDefaultPosition. Once that move has had its time, both radial axes go in (towards the mouse) to RadialInSteps from home (0: they stay where they are), and SpoutsReady once that move has had its time too. Once the DoneSubjectName subject ends, DoneCommand moves the stage. On a rig without a stage, SpoutsReady at once and nothing moves: a QC workflow also runs on boxes, and a workflow's graph is fixed, so the piece runs only behind this condition. Needs the RigConfigs, RigFile (OpenRigs.Devices ReadLabRig), ControlEvents, PathPrefix, SubjectId and Events (OpenRigs.Logging NoExperimentFolder), HarpClockSet, ReadyStages and SpoutsReady subjects; LickSpoutStage declares its own SpoutStepSize and spout commands.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>Stage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>it.StepperDriver != null &amp;&amp; it.StepperDriver.Count &gt; 0</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
        <Property Name="RadialInSteps" />
        <Property Name="DoneSubjectName" />
        <Property Name="DoneCommand" />
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:SelectMany">
        <Name>Stage</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Devices:LickSpoutStage.bonsai" />
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:Take">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="RadialInSteps" DisplayName="RadialInSteps" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:RadialIn">
                <vc:RadialInSteps>0</vc:RadialInSteps>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Target</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="vc:WaitForMove" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
                <Value>true</Value>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Name" DisplayName="DoneSubjectName" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
              <Name>UNMAPPED</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="rx:TakeLast">
                <rx:Count>1</rx:Count>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="ExternalizedMapping">
              <Property Name="Command" DisplayName="DoneCommand" />
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
              <Combinator xsi:type="dev:ToLickSpoutCommand">
                <dev:Command>SpoutsIn</dev:Command>
              </Combinator>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
              <Name>LickSpoutStage.Commands</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="4" To="6" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="7" To="8" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="8" To="9" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="9" To="10" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="11" To="12" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="12" To="13" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="13" To="15" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="14" To="15" Label="Source2" />
            <Edge From="15" To="16" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="16" To="17" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>RigConfigs</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="rx:Condition">
        <Name>NoStage?</Name>
        <Workflow>
          <Nodes>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
              <Name>Source1</Name>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="scr:ExpressionTransform">
              <scr:Expression>it.StepperDriver == null || it.StepperDriver.Count == 0</scr:Expression>
            </Expression>
            <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowOutput" />
          </Nodes>
          <Edges>
            <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
            <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
          </Edges>
        </Workflow>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="Combinator">
        <Combinator xsi:type="BooleanProperty">
          <Value>true</Value>
        </Combinator>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MulticastSubject">
        <Name>SpoutsReady</Name>
      </Expression>
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="3" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="2" To="3" Label="Source2" />
      <Edge From="4" To="5" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="5" To="6" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="6" To="7" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
